  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 22
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: The solemn sanctity of the Nobat as a whole makes it not just a collection
    of sound-making props, but a living historical archive.
