  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 17
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: In ancient times, Nobat musicians held an extremely noble status and
    even enjoyed hereditary privileges, as they held the court musical melodies directly
    tied to royal dignity.
