  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 70
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 'Historically, Java, Myanmar, and mainland Southeast Asia were the four
    major ancient bronze gong manufacturing centers of the world, '
